{"title":"Popular music of 2025","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/930617585/0/marginalrevolution~Popular-music-of.html","date":1764567556000,"content":"<p>Usually I wait until the year passes before dipping too deeply into these offerings, but this year I have been impressed by:</p>\r\n<p>Bad Bunny, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/DeB-TiRAR-M-S-FOToS/dp/B0FRC3NSVP/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1KNCAQJNH3SNG&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.-tyzVeN1BEZ13vG5Ocd9XbcbgSVYqc5reizc0l8Eqg1P2-5L7M-P09OAJ28PK6FurdOkqjETwXsJY-Jcs38XCy67MbbAv8TjykzxfTwkBQkahDRSS93EpOhTVC1BOkOeNoDXh3iXKmbWhVoDCJHliXRvz6J8NSmodWzu_a86U9dYbglsowmF13Fue6pUDw9QRlbwHsEemzN0T4mW0nqtBTnZd1m7O-HYEDiU9YM2IKI.FowTq_--7WgTGCM7_4qic67wbdzGfKd_qKmmmehPH8c&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=bad+bunny&amp;qid=1764369817&amp;sprefix=bad+bunny%2Caps%2C106&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">‘DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS’</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Geese, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Getting-Killed-Geese/dp/B0FGY49HG4/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1Q2TM2AMJDAWU&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.eT5ug4JqiKqnE5antsHungCEvEJ7H6u7NkkYTBxiUh0GfpeQWVF7hlnteXHFquV0iPEPUfVD8j_AVKceJ_XpHYnaaPKTgtsEO4_o9HkZ6nOQbj9ZtVjdVHDz-lHthk6YLm1uD3p3H8WsLkBtuYuwCmy04ruAMpvUpt3fOLpZRk4z4PPAPlcqt3mj1PN5ByBO.qCqMd1efivf7VaRWQGjFLXx4xo_n_oN4PgumOiL1BbA&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=geese+getting+killed&amp;qid=1764369779&amp;sprefix=geese+getting+killed%2Caps%2C96&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Getting Killed</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Rosalia, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/LUX-Rosalia/dp/B0FVNGF9PG/ref=sr_1_1?crid=3QGFDLMEDIBDK&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.R3FWCxX-ZLHUxEwke_Po-NYlKstvcgLnZsEMAw9BOSvGjHj071QN20LucGBJIEps.E7yVFgAoWU6mqekrCFrS3WDF40u1lMQDQwfWzppNCAk&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=rosalia+lux+cd&amp;qid=1764369744&amp;sprefix=rosalia+lux%2Caps%2C106&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Lux</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Oklou, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/choke-enough-Oklou/dp/B0DNRFGH4W/ref=sr_1_1?crid=TJSA6H5CPV88&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.UMCRT1oKcdA9V6uMJL5vBbpyySS88VYvhMi8N1EcAr4._16Tso4-N8Qv3nYgE3v2V8HHIPX6q3Wf6miKjVz4yeo&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=choke+enough+oklou+cd&amp;qid=1764369710&amp;sprefix=oklou+choke%2Caps%2C100&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Choke Enough</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Saya Gray, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/SAYA-Saya-Gray/dp/B0DJS1H9GS/ref=sr_1_1?crid=24IVJ6U9145T5&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.qPNXbzlhWtNA-8R5n37e8w.lJAfee2W5NMmuTH0F3JDe5bYWSiOMeVU4Z349zMHwLY&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=saya+gray+cd&amp;qid=1764369684&amp;sprefix=saya+gray%2Caps%2C119&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Saya</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Fontaines D.C., <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Romance-Fontaines-D-C/dp/B0D12DHS1D/ref=sr_1_1?crid=1DWMO1ZRQMZME&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.vMpPG3Oqq20Kx8HDGV8ctLOqqbXJog5GuTkD-yR7N7ZehzESp8nBpzmqTHiT0mG6eoTVw2sgESpMJLOaniRciHq4k1Dr-TEi06LK-uqyJh8.6GnAZj45bukM4llU2g9tFA33H4SgTwiAvhxfjNd9Q0I&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=fontaines+dc+cd&amp;qid=1764369642&amp;sprefix=fontain%2Caps%2C115&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Romance</a>, late 2024.</p>\r\n<p>Jeff Tweedy, <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.amazon.com/Twilight-Override-Jeff-Tweedy/dp/B0FFR9FKJ1/ref=sr_1_1?crid=OJTADQHQNNSN&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.R12IJ5wICyaoJ3tDksM6BeNRDuSlc30b4dZk8_LWXFnBUlUU1Z1YkaVhyYVK_it2VY4PG2PndfIn6I1iynCb3E0aDEx5CXSNLo9OHM2ZB8RJYixTFyfl0Rm-GAWcc2fzBUXwSQdL_glFnDPL0YvHN-YgiYuRvsEITtEI1K5tR6Fqh_HIJu_vaYZ6aCMMudstmSpUrbR4NX6ge2RjjErC7h2FchYzwaW3GcXoJ644rQs.4mAq5VCg8eoQNI2EXGo4RTWWQ6E3FYUpaccFamxS3QY&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;keywords=jeff+tweedy+cd&amp;qid=1764369598&amp;sprefix=jeff+tweedy%2Caps%2C121&amp;sr=8-1\" target=\"_blank\">Twilight Override</a>.</p>\r\n<p>Raye, assorted songs.</p>\r\n<p>There will be more, that is my first cut at a list of interest.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/popular-music-of-2025.html\">Popular music of 2025</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/930617585/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/930617585/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/930617585/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/930617585/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/930617585/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/930617585/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/popular-music-of-2025.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/popular-music-of-2025.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/popular-music-of-2025.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/12/popular-music-of-2025.html#comment-160989970\">Jeff Tweedy sounds a bit like Lou Reed from Velvet Underground ...</a> <i>by Atom</i></li><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution